        "raw": "<p>Just got my Oblivaeon shipment today. Very hype.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sadly, my \"Villains &amp; Environment\" drawer is well and truly stuck. I know everyone there is totally backed up and getting a response to an email will take weeks. I'm going to have to destroy the drawer to get it out. I've tried a hair dryer (it's gotta be glue at the back), a thin plastic paint stirrer down the sides. I've done everything I can think of.&nbsp; The front of the drawer is already pretty jacked.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Does anyone know if they'll replace this? I mean, technically, I'm the one damaging it but I'm doing so because I have ZERO choice.&nbsp; I'm also open to suggestions regarding another way to salvage this. I'm not joking when I say it's COMPLETELY stuck. It will wiggle ever so slightly in the drawer but won't move forward at all.</p>",
