        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-03T02:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"torian\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/919ad9/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> torian:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If it’s the glue in the back you can try using the hair dryer on the outside of the back of the box to try to loosen the glue holding the drawer on the inside. I wouldn’t hold out much hope though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They said they already tried it.</p>\n<p>Definitely contact GtG: this is the sort of thing they absolutely should replace. I haven’t heard anything about the status of timing of that. In particular, I imagine they’re getting more requests than expected, and don’t know if they currently have enough stock in the US (besides being behind in e-mail, of course).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EDIT: Oops, just saw the <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-oblivaeon/posts/2305009\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">latest Kickstarter update</a>. There’s a Google Doc form they want you to fill out.</p>",
